hadiths[61]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1335","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne Utaarid Taimi ko bazaar mein aik reshmi jora, baichnay ke liye, rakha hua dekha aur wo aik aisa shakhs tha jo badshahon ke paas jaya karta aur un se rupiya hasil kiya karta tha. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne Utaarid ko dekha ke us ne bazaar mein aik reshmi jora rakha hai, agar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ko khareed lein aur jab Arab ke wafd aatay hain us waqt pehna karein to munasib hai. Rawi ne kaha ke main samajhta hun ke unhon ne ye bhi kaha ke Juma ko bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) pehna karein, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke reshmi kapra duniya mein wo pehnay ga jis ka aakhirat mein hissa nahi. Phir us ke baad Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas chand reshmi joray aaye to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Umar, Usama bin Zaid aur Ali (raziyallahu anhuma) ko aik aik jora diya aur farmaya ke us ko phaar kar apni apni auraton ke dopattay bana de. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) apna jora le kar aaye aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne ye jora mujhe bheja hai aur kal hi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Utaarid ke joray ke baaray mein kya farmaya tha? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main ne ye jora tumharay paas, tumharay apne, pehnnay ke liye nahi balke is liye bheja tha ke us, ko baich kar us, se faida hasil karo. Aur Usama (raziyallahu anhu) apna jora pehan kar chalay to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko aisi nigaah se dekha ke un ko maloom ho gaya ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) naraaz hain. Unhon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap mujhe kya dekhtay hain, Aap hi ne to ye jora mujhe bheja hai to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main ne is liye nahi bheja ke tum khud pehno balke is liye bheja ke phaar kar apni auraton ke dopattay bana lo. (Muslim). (Hulla-e-seera se murad reshmi jora hai.)"
"1336","[AI-translation] Khaleefa bin Ka'b Abu Zibyan kehtay hain ke main ne Abdullah bin Zubair (raziyallahu anhuma) se suna, wo khutba padhtay hue keh rahay thay ke Ae logon, khabardaar raho! Apni auraton ko reshmi kapray mat pehnao, kyunke main ne Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se suna wo kehtay thay ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke hareer, reshmi kapra, mat pehno kyunke jo koi duniya mein pehnay ga wo aakhirat mein nahi pehnay ga. (Muslim: 6/140). Baab: Muttaqiyon ko farrooj-e-hareer pehanna munasib nahi."
"1337","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik reshmi qaba tohfa mein aayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ko pehna aur namaz padhi, phir namaz se farigh ho kar us ko zor se utara jaisay us ko bura jantay hain. Phir farmaya ke ye parhezgaaron ke laiq nahi hai. (Muslim: 6/143). Baab: Do ungli bhar se zyada hareer pehnnay se mumaniat."
"1338","[AI-translation] Abu Usman kehtay hain ke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein likha aur ham, Iran ke aik mulk, Aazarbaijan mein thay ke Ae Utba bin Farqad! Ye jo maal jo tere paas hai na tera kamaya hua hai na tere baap ka, na teri maan ka, pas tu Musalmanon ko un ke thikanon mein sair kar jis tarah tu apne thikanay mein sair hota hai, yani baghair talab ke un ko pahuncha de. Aur tum aish karnay se bacho aur mushrikon ki waza se aur reshmi kapra pehnnay se, bhi bacho, magar itna aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni darmiyani aur shahadat ki ungli ko uthaya aur un ko mila liya, yani do ungli chaura haashiya agar kahein laga ho to jaaiz hai. Zuhair ne Aasim se kaha ke yehi kitab mere paas bhi thi. (Muslim). (Hareer se murad resham hai.)"
"1339","[AI-translation] Suwaid bin Ghafla se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne, maqam, Jabiya mein khutba padha to kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hareer, reshmi kapra, pehnnay se mana farmaya magar, ye ke, do ungli ya teen ya chaar ungli ke barabar, ho. (Muslim: 6/141). Baab: Deebaaj ki qaba pehnnay se mumaniat."
"1340","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik roz resham ki qaba pehni jo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas tohfa mein aayi thi, phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usi waqt utaar daali aur Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ko bhej di. Logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne to ye utaar daali? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Jibrail ne mujhe mana kar diya hai. Ye sun kar Umar (raziyallahu anhu) rotay hue Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Jis cheez ko Aap ne napasand kiya wo mujh ko di, mera kya haal ho ga? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main ne tumhein pehnnay ko nahi di balke is liye di ke baich do, to unhon ne do hazaar dirham mein baich di. (Muslim: 6/141-142)"
"1341","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Zubair bin Awwam (raziyallahu anhuma) ko safar mein reshmi qamees pehnnay ki ijazat di, us wajah se ke un ko khaarish ho gayi thi ya kuch aur marz tha. Aik riwayat mein hai ke un donon ne jooon ki shikayat ki thi. (Muslim: 6/143). Baab: Deebaaj ke naram kapray ki rukhsat."
"1342","[AI-translation] Abdullah se riwayat hai jo ke Asma bint Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) ka maula aur Ataa ke larkay ka maamun tha, ne kaha ke mujhe Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas bheja aur kehlaya ke main ne suna hai ke tum teen cheezon ko haraam kehtay ho, aik to kapray ko jis mein reshmi naqsh hon, doosray urjuwan, yani surkh dhaddhaata, zeen posh ko aur teesray tamam Rajab ke maheenay mein rozay rakhnay ko, to Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Rajab ke maheenay ke rozon ko kaun haraam kahay ga? Jo shakhs hamesha roza rakhay ga. Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) hamesha roza ilawa Eidain aur Ayyaam-e-Tashreeq ke rakhtay thay aur un ka mazhab yehi hai ke saum-e-dahr makrooh nahi hai. Aur kapray ke reshmi naqoosh ka tu ne zikr kiya hai to main ne Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se suna wo kehtay thay ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke hareer, resham, wo pehnay ga jis ka aakhirat mein koi hissa nahi, to mujhe darr hua ke kahin naqshi kapra bhi hareer, resham, na ho. Aur urjuwani zeen posh, to khud Abdullah ka zeen posh urjuwani hai. Ye sab main ne ja kar Asma (raziyallahu anha) se kaha to unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka ye jubba maujood hai, phir unhon ne Tayaalisa Kasrawani jubba, jo Iran ke badshah Kisra ki taraf mansoob tha, nikala jis ke girebaan par resham laga hua tha aur daaman bhi reshmi thay. Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke ye jubba Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ki wafaat tak un ke paas tha. Jab wo faut ho gayein to ye jubba main ne le liya aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ko pehna kartay thay. Ab ham us ko dho kar us ka pani beemaron ko shifa ke liye pilatay hain. Sanjaaf-e-hareer yani daaman par resham ki patti chaar ungli tak durust hai, us se zyada haraam hai. (Muslim). (Alam se murad reshmi naqsh hai; meesara se murad zeen posh hai; saum-e-dahr se murad hamesha roza hai.)"
"1343","[AI-translation] Ameer-ul-Momineen Khaleefa-e-Raashid Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ukaidir Dooma ke badshah ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aik reshmi kapray ka tohfa bheja, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wo mujhe de diya aur farmaya ke us ko phaar kar teenon Fatima ke dopattay, aik Fatima (raziyallahu anha) ka aur doosri Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ki walida Fatima bint Asad ka aur teesri Fatima bint Hamza (raziyallahu anha) ka, bana lo. (Muslim: 6/142). Baab: Qassi aur muasfar pehnnay aur sonay ki angoothi se mumaniat."
"1344","[AI-translation] Ameer-ul-Momineen Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qassi, aik qism ka reshmi kapra hai, aur kusum mein ranga hua kapra pehnnay se aur sonay ki angoothi pehnnay se aur ruku mein Quran padhnay se mana farmaya hai. (Muslim: 6/144)"
"1345","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe kusum ke rang ke do kapray pehnay hue dekha to farmaya ke ye kafiron ke kapray hain un ko mat pehan. Main ne kaha ke kya main unhein dho dun? Aap ne farmaya ke balke jala de. (Muslim: 6/144). Baab: Zafraan laganay se mumaniat."
"1346","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mard ko zafraan laganay se aur, zafraan ke rang se, mana farmaya hai. (Muslim: 6/155). Baab: Baalon ko rangna aur safed baal badalna."
"1347","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Quhafa (raziyallahu anhu) jis saal Makka fatah hua aaye aur un ka sar aur un ki daarhi saghaama ki tarah safed thi, saghaama aik safed ghaas ka naam hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us safaidi ko kisi cheez se badal do aur siyah rang se bacho. (Muslim: 6/155)"
"1348","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Yahud aur Nasaara khizaab nahi kartay to tum un ka khilaf karo, yani khizaab kiya karo lekin jaisay pehli hadees mein guzra, siyah khizaab nahi. (Muslim: 6/155). Baab: Hibra ka libaas."
"1349","[AI-translation] Qatada kehtay hain ke ham ne Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kaun sa kapra pasand tha? Unhon ne kaha ke Yaman ki chaadar, jo dhaari daar hoti hai, ye kapra nihayat mazboot aur umda hota hai. (Muslim: 6/144). Baab: Kaalay baalon ka murat-tah kamal orhna. (Hibra se murad Yamani chaadar hai; mirt se murad kambal hai.)"
"1350","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik subah ko niklay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kaalay baalon ka aik kambal orhay hue thay jis par paalaan ki tasveerein bani hui thin. (Muslim: 6/145). Baab: Mota tehband aur gathri band kapra pehanna."
"1351","[AI-translation] Abu Burda (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaya, unhon ne aik mota tehband nikala jo Yaman mein banta hai aur aik kambal jis ko mulabbada kehtay hain, phir Allah Taala ki qasam khayi ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki wafaat un donon kapron mein hui. (Muslim: 6/145). Baab: Qaleen banana."
"1352","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab main ne nikah kiya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kya tere paas qaleen waghera hain? Main ne arz kiya ke hamaray paas qaleen kahan? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke anqareeb tumharay paas hon ge. Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke meri biwi ke paas aik qaleen hai, main us ko kehta hun ke us ko door kar to wo kehti hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tha ke anqareeb tumharay paas qaleen hon ge, to Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) un ko makrooh jaan kar door karna chahtay thay kyunke wo duniya ki zeenat hai. Anmaat qaleenon aur usi qism ke behtareen kapron ko bhi kaha jata hai jo bistar par bichaye jatay hain. (Muslim: 6/146). Baab: Zaroorat ke bichhonay rakhna. (Namat bistar ki chaadar hai.)"
"1353","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Aik bistar aadmi ke liye chahiye aur aik us ki biwi ke liye, aik bistar mehmaan ke liye aur chautha shaitaan ka ho ga. Yani jo logon ko dikhanay aur apni bartari zaahir karnay ke liye banaya jaye. (Muslim: 6/146)"
"1354","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka, bistar, bichhona jis par Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sotay thay, wo chamray ka tha aur us ke andar khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi. (Muslim: 6/145). Baab: Samee kapra lapaitna aur aik kapray mein ghut maarna."
"1355","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne baayein haath se khanay, aik joota pehan kar chalnay, aik hi kapra saaray badan par lapaitnay se ya ghot maar kar baithnay se mana farmaya hai. Aik kapray mein apni sharmgah kholay hue, jis ko ihtiba kehtay hain, ye aik kapray mein satr ke khulnay ki soorat mein mana hai aur kai kapray hon ya satr khulnay ka darr na ho to makrooh hai. (Muslim: 6/154). Baab: Chit lait kar aik paon doosray par rakhnay se mumaniat."
"1356","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi tum mein se chit na laitay ke phir aik paon doosray par rakh le. (Muslim: 6/156). Baab: Chit lait kar aik paon doosray par rakhna jaaiz hai."
"1357","[AI-translation] Ubbaad bin Tameem apne chacha (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko masjid mein chit laitay hue dekha ke aik paon doosray par rakhay hue thay. (Muslim: 6/154-155). Baab: Tehband nasf pindli tak uthana."
"1358","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay se guzra aur meri chaadar latak rahi thi, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Abdullah! Apni chaadar oonchi kar. Main ne utha li to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aur oonchi kar. Main ne aur oonchi ki. Phir main, apni tehband ko, utha kar hi rakhta tha, yahan tak ke logon ne poocha ke kahan tak uthani chahiye? Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke nisf pindli tak. (Muslim: 6/148). Baab: Jo takabbur se kapra latkaye usay Allah nahi dekhay ga."
"1359","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ziyad kehtay hain ke main ne Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se suna, unhon ne aik shakhs ko apna tehband latkaye hue dekha aur wo apne paon se zameen par maarnay laga aur wo Bahrain par ameer tha aur kehta tha ke ameer aaya ameer aaya, ye dekh kar Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya hai ke Allah Taala us shakhs ko nahi dekhay ga jo apni azaar ghuroor se latkaye ga. (Muslim: 6/148)"
"1360","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala qayamat ke din teen aadmiyon se na baat karay ga, na un ki taraf, rehmat ki nigaah se, dekhay ga, na un ko, gunaahon se, paak karay ga aur un ko dukh ka azaab ho ga. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne teen baar yehi farmaya to Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke barbaad ho gaye wo log aur nuqsan mein paray, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo kaun log hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aik to apni azaar, tehband, pajama, patloon, shalwar waghera, ko, takhnon se neechay, latkanay wala, doosra ehsaan kar ke ehsaan ko jatanay wala aur teesra jhooti qasam se apna saamaan baichnay wala. (Muslim: 1/71). Baab: Jo takabbur se kapray ghaseetay."
"1361","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala qayamat ke din us shakhs ki taraf nahi dekhay ga jo apna kapra ghuroor se zameen par khainchay, ghaseetay. (Muslim: 6/147). Baab: Jo shakhs itraye usay zameen mein dhansa diya gaya."
"1362","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik shakhs apne baalon aur chaadar, tehband, par itratay hue ja raha tha, aakhir kaar wo zameen mein dhansa diya gaya. Phir wo qayamat tak usi mein utarta rahay ga, shayad wo shakhs usi ummat mein ho aur sahih ye hai ke agli ummat mein tha. (Muslim: 6/148). Baab: Farishtay us ghar mein nahi jatay jismein kutta ya tasveer ho. (Jumma se murad kandhon tak baal hain; waajim se murad khamosh fikarmand hai.)"
"1363","[AI-translation] Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik din subah ko chup chaap uthay, jaisay koi ranjeeda hota hai. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aaj main ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka chehra-e-mubarak aisa dekha ke aaj tak waisa nahi dekha tha, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Jibrail (alaihissalam) ne mujh se us raat milnay ka waada kiya tha magar nahi milay aur Allah ki qasam unhon ne kabhi waada khilafi nahi ki. Us ke baad Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke dil mein us kuttay ke bachay ka khayal aaya jo hamaray deray mein tha, to usay nikalnay ka hukm diya pas wo nikaal diya gaya. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne pani liya aur jahan wo kutta baitha tha, wahan wo pani chhirak diya. Jab shaam hui to Jibrail (alaihissalam) aaye to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne mujh se guzishta raat milnay ka waada kiya tha. Unhon ne kaha ke haan, lekin ham us ghar mein nahi jatay jis mein kutta ya tasveer ho. Phir us ki subah ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kutton ke qatl ka hukm diya, yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chotay baagh ka kutta bhi qatl karwa diya aur baray baagh ke kuttay ko chhor diya. (Muslim)"
"1364","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Farishtay us ghar mein nahi jatay jis mein moortiyan aur tasveerein hon. (Muslim: 6/162). Baab: Farishtay us ghar mein nahi jatay jismein tasveer ho magar kapray ki naqsh."
"1365","[AI-translation] Busr bin Sa'id, Zaid bin Khalid se riwayat kartay hain aur wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahabi Abu Talha (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ghar mein tasveer ho, us mein farishtay daakhil nahi hotay. Busr ne kaha ke Zaid beemar hue to ham un ki beemaar pursi ko gaye, un ke darwaza par aik parda latka tha jis par moorat thi. Main ne Ubaidullah Khaulani se kaha jo ke Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) ka rabeeb tha ke kya khud Zaid hi ne ham se tasveer ki hadees bayan nahi ki thi? Aur ab tasveer wala parda latkaya hai. Ubaidullah ne kaha ke jab unhon ne bayan ki thi to tum ne suna nahi ke Aap ne farmaya tha magar kapray ki naqsh, yani bistar par bichi tasveer jaaiz hai. (Muslim). (Asal mein saubah tha, Muslim se sahih kiya.)"
"1366","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas aaye aur main ne taaq ya machaan ko apne aik parda se dhaanka tha, jis mein tasveerein thin. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye dekha to us ko phaar daala aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chehray ka rang badal gaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Aisha! Sab se zyada sakht azaab qayamat ke din un logon ko ho ga jo Allah Taala ki makhlooq ki shaklein banatay hain. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke main ne us ko kaat kar aik takiya ya do takiye banaye. Tasveer walay kapray ka takiya sirf usi waqt banaya ja sakta hai jabke takiya bananay se tasveer kharab ho jaye. (Muslim: 6/159)"
"1367","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) safar se tashreef laaye aur main ne apne darwazay par aik qaleen latkaya tha, jis par ghoron ki tasveerein bani thin, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hukm se main ne usay utaar diya. (Muslim: 6/158). Baab: Gaddeela jismein tasveerein hon aur usay takiya banana."
"1368","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne aik gadeela, gadday ke upar ka kapra, khareeda, jis mein tasveerein thin. Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ko dekha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) darwazay par kharay rahay aur andar daakhil na hue. Main ne pehchan liya ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chehra-e-mubarak par ranj hai. Main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main Allah aur us ke Rasool ke saamnay tauba karti hun, mera kya gunah hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye gadeela kaisa hai? Main ne kaha ke main ne us ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baithnay aur takiya laganay ke liye khareeda hai, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jinhon ne ye tasveerein banayi hain unhein azaab ho ga aur un se kaha jaye ga ke jo tum ne banaya hai us mein jaan daalo. (Muslim). (Sahwa se murad chota kamra hai; qiraam se murad ranga kapra hai.)"
"1369","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Abu Hasan kehtay hain ke Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas aik shakhs aaya aur kehnay laga ke main tasveerein bananay wala hun, mujhe us ka bata dijiye. Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke mere qareeb aa. Wo paas aa gaya. Phir unhon ne kaha ke aur qareeb aa. Wo aur paas aa gaya, yahan tak ke Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne apna haath us ke sar par rakha aur kaha ke main tujh se wo kehta hun jo main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, main ne suna Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke har aik tasveer bananay wala jahannam mein jaye ga aur har aik tasveer ke badal aik jaandaar cheez banayi jaye gi, jo us ko jahannam mein takleef degi. Aur agar tu ne tasveer banani hi hai to darakhton aur be jaan cheezon ki bana. (Muslim). (Mumtahan bistar par bichi tasveer jaaiz hai.)"
"1370","[AI-translation] Abu Zura kehtay hain ke main Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath Marwan ke ghar mein daakhil hua wahan tasveerein dekhein to kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke Allah Taala farmata hai: Us se zyada qasoorwaar kaun ho ga jo meri tarah takhleeq karay? Acha aik cheonti ya gandum ya jau ka aik daana bana dein. (Muslim: 6/162). Baab: Sonay ki angoothi pehnnay, chaandi se peenay, resham aur deebaaj se mumaniat."
"1371","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein saat baaton ka hukm kiya aur saat baaton se mana farmaya. Hamein hukm kiya beemaar pursi karnay ka, janazay ke saath, qabr tak, janay ka, chheenk ka jawab denay ka, qasam ko poora karnay ka, mazloom ki madad karnay ka, dawat qabool karnay ka aur Islam phelanay ya aam karnay ka. Aur mana kiya sonay ki angoothi pehnnay se, chaandi ke bartan mein khanay peenay se, zeen posh, yani reshmi zeen poshon se agar reshmi na hon to mana nahi hai, qassi ke pehnnay se, jo Misr ke aik maqam Qass ka bana hua aik reshmi kapra hai, reshmi kapra pehnnay se aur istabraq aur deebaaj se, ye donon bhi reshmi kapray hain. (Muslim: 6/135). Baab: Sonay ki angoothi utaar phenkna."
"1372","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik shakhs ke haath mein sonay ki angoothi dekhi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne utaar kar phaink di aur farmaya ke tum mein se koi jahannam ki aag ke angaray ka qasd karta hai, phir us ko apne haath mein le leta hai. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef le gaye to logon ne us shakhs se kaha ke tu apni angoothi utha le aur us, ki qeemat, se nafa hasil kar le. Wo bola ke Allah ki qasam main us ko haath nahi lagaun ga, jis ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phaink diya. SubhanAllah sahaba ka taqwa aur ittiba us darja ko pahuncha tha. Agar wo utha leta aur baich leta to jaaiz tha. (Muslim: 6/149)"
"1373","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sonay ki aik angoothi banwayi thi jab pehantay to us ka nag Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hatheeli ki taraf rakhtay. Phir aik din Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mimbar par baithay to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wo angoothi utaar daali aur farmaya ke main us angoothi ko pehanta tha aur us ka nag andar ki taraf rakhta tha, phir us ko phaink diya aur farmaya ke Allah ki qasam ab main us ko kabhi nahi pehnun ga. Ye dekh kar logon ne bhi apni angoothiyan phaink dein. (Muslim: 6/149). (Qaal se murad Ibn Abbas ne kaha.)"
"1374","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaandi ki aik angoothi banwayi aur wo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke haath mein thi, phir wo Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke haath mein rahi, phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ke haath mein rahi, phir Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ke haath mein rahi, yahan tak ke un se Arees ke kunwein mein gir gayi. Us angoothi ka naqsh ye tha: Muhammad Rasoolullah, sallallahu alaihi wa sallam. (Muslim: 6/150)"
"1375","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaandi ki aik angoothi banwayi aur us mein: Muhammad Rasoolullah, sallallahu alaihi wa sallam, ka naqsh banwaya. Logon se farmaya ke main ne chaandi ki aik angoothi banwayi hai aur us mein: Muhammad Rasoolullah, ka naqsh banwaya hai, to koi apni angoothi mein ye naqsh na banwaye. (Muslim: 6/151)"
"1376","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne, Iran ke badshah, Kisra aur, Room ke badshah, Qaisar aur, Habsh ke badshah, Najashi ko khat likhna chaha to logon ne arz kiya ke ye badshah koi khat na lein ge jab tak us par muhar na ho. Aakhir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik angoothi banwayi jis ka chhalla chaandi ka tha aur us mein Muhammad Rasoolullah naqsh tha. (Muslim: 6/151). Baab: Habshi nageenay wali angoothi aur daayein haath mein pehanna."
"1377","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaandi ki aik angoothi apne daayein haath mein pehni, jis ka nageena Habsha ka tha aur us ka nageena Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) andar ko hatheeli ki taraf rakhtay thay. (Muslim: 6/152). Baab: Baayein haath ki chhungli mein angoothi pehanna."
"1378","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki angoothi us ungli mein thi aur baayein haath ki chhungli ki taraf ishara kiya. (Muslim: 6/152). Baab: Darmiyani aur us se agli ungli mein angoothi se mumaniat."
"1379","[AI-translation] Ameer-ul-Momineen Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe us ungli mein ya us ungli mein angoothi pehnnay se mana farmaya aur darmiyani ungli aur us ke paas wali ungli ki taraf ishara kiya. Kyunke ye ungliyan har kaam mein shareek hoti hain aur angoothi se haraj ho ga, albatta chhungli alag rehti hai usi mein angoothi pehanna behtar hai. (Muslim: 6/153). Baab: Jootay pehanna aur kasrat se jootay rakhna. (Abu Zubair ki riwayat mu'anan hai lekin shawahid sahih hain.)"
"1380","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se aik jihad mein jis mein ham shareek thay, suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke jootiyan bohat pehna karo kyunke jootiyan pehnnay se aadmi sawaar rehta hai, yani misl sawaar ke paon ko takleef nahi hoti. (Muslim: 6/153)"
"1381","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi joota pehnay to daayein paon se shuru karay aur jab utaray to baayein se shuru karay aur chahiye ke donon, jootay, pehnay ya donon utaar daalay. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi aik joota pehan kar na chalay, donon pehnay ya donon utaar day. (Muslim: 6/153). Baab: Qaza se mumaniat."
"1382","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qaza se mana kiya. Rawi ne kaha ke main ne Nafi se poocha ke qaza kya hai. To unhon ne kaha ke bachay ke sar ka kuch hissa mondna aur kuch chhor dena. (Muslim: 6/164). Baab: Aurat ka baalon mein jor laganay se mumaniat."
"1383","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik aurat aayi aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Meri beti dulhan bani hai aur khasra ki beemari se us ke baal gir gaye hain, to kya main us ke baalon mein jor laga dun? Yani masnooi baal waghera jo bazaar mein miltay hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne, baalon mein, jor laganay aur lagwanay wali par laanat ki hai. (Muslim: 6/165). Baab: Aurat ka sar mein kuch jorna mana hai. (Hasba se murad phoray hain; tamarraqa se murad girna hai.)"
"1384","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aurat ko apne sar mein jor laganay se sakhti se mana farmaya hai. (Muslim: 6/167)"
"1385","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Muawiya bin Abu Sufyan (raziyallahu anhuma) se suna, jis saal ke Hajj kiya, unhon ne mimbar par kaha aur baalon ka aik chotila apne haath mein liya, jo ghulam ke paas tha ke Ae Madina walo! Tumharay aalim kahan hain? Main ne Rasoolullah se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us se mana kartay thay, yani jor laganay se, aur farmatay thay ke Bani Israeel usi tarah tabah hue jab un ki auraton ne ye kaam shuru kiya, yani aish ishrat aur shahwat parasti mein par gaye aur larai se dil churanay lagay. (Muslim: 6/168). Baab: Godnay waliyon aur daanton ko kushada karnay waliyon par laanat. (Qussa peshani ke baal hain; harasi ghulam hai.)"
"1386","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Allah Taala ne laanat ki godnay waliyon aur gadwanay waliyon par aur chehray ke baal ukhairnay waliyon par aur ukharwanay waliyon par aur daanton ko khoobsurti ke liye kushaada karnay waliyon par, taake khoobsurat o kamsin maloom hon, aur Allah Taala ki khilqat, paidaish, badalnay waliyon par. Phir ye khabar Bani Asad ki aik aurat ko pahunchi jisay Umm Yaqoob kaha jata tha aur wo Quran ki qaariya thi, to wo Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aayi aur boli ke mujhe kya khabar pahunchi hai ke tum ne godnay waliyon aur gadwanay waliyon par aur munh ke baal ukhaarnay waliyon par aur ukharwanay waliyon, aur daanton ko kushaada karnay waliyon par aur Allah Taala ki khilqat ko badalnay waliyon par laanat ki hai? To Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main us par laanat kyun na karun jis par Allah Taala ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne laanat ki aur ye to Allah Taala ki kitab mein maujood hai? Wo aurat boli ke main to do jildon mein jis qadar Quran tha, parh daala lekin mujhe nahi mila, to Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar tu ne parha hai to Allah Taala ka ye farman tujhe zaroor mila ho ga ke: Jo kuch Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumhein batlaye us ko thaamay raho aur jis se mana karay us se baaz raho, Surah Hashr: 7. Wo aurat boli ke un baaton mein se to baazi baatein tumhari aurat bhi karti hai. Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ja dekh. Wo un ki aurat ke paas gayi to kuch na paya. Phir laut kar aayi aur kehnay lagi ke un mein se koi baat main ne nahi dekhi, to Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar wo aisa karti to ham us se sohbat na kartay. (Muslim)"
"1387","[AI-translation] Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik aurat Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur kehnay lagi ke meri aik sautan hai, kya mujhe us baat se gunah ho ga ke main, us ka dil jalanay ko, ye kahun ke khawand ne mujhe ye diya hai halanke us ne nahi diya, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jis ko koi cheez na mili aur ye bayan karay ke us ko mili hai, to us ki misaal aisi hai jaisay kisi ne faraib ke do kapray pehan liye, aur apne tayein zaahid muttaqi batlaya halanke asal mein duniyadaar faraibi hai. La haula wa la quwwata illa billah. (Muslim: 6/169). Baab: Nangay libaas wali aurtein. (Muslim mein qaalat Ya Rasoolullah bhi hai.)"
"1388","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya hai ke dozakhyon ki do qismein aisi hain jin ko main ne nahi dekha. Aik to wo log jin ke paas bailon ki dumon ki tarah ke koray hain aur wo logon ko un se maartay hain aur doosri wo aurtein jo, libaas, pehanti hain magar nangi hain, yani satr ke laiq aaza khulay hain jaisa ke saarhi pehan kar auraton ke sar, pait aur paon waghera khulay rehtay hain ya kapray aisay tang aur baareek pehanti hain jin mein se badan nazar aata hai to goya nangi hain, wo seedhi raah se behkanay wali aur khud behaknay wali hain aur un ke sar bakhti, oont ki aik qism hai, oont ki kohaan ki tarah aik taraf jhukay hue hon ge. Wo jannat mein daakhil na hon gi aur na us ki khushbu payein gi halanke us ki khushbu itni door se aati hai. (Muslim: 6/168). Baab: Janwaron ki gardan se haar kaatna."
"1389","[AI-translation] Abu Bashir Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath safar mein thay to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik paigham pahunchanay walay ko bheja. Abdullah bin Abu Bakr ne kaha ke main samajhta hun us qaasid ne ye kaha jabke log us waqt apne sonay ke maqamaat mein thay, ke kisi oont ke galay mein taant ka haar ya haar na rahay magar us ko kaat daalein. Malik ne kaha ke main khayal karta hun ke ye nazar na lagnay ke khayal se daaltay thay. (Muslim: 6/163). (Asal mein alaikum tha.)"
"1390","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Farishtay un musafiron ke saath nahi rehtay jin ke saath ghanti ya kutta ho. (Muslim: 6/163)"
"1391","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ghanti shaitaan ka baaja hai. (Muslim: 6/163)"
"1392","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne munh par maarnay aur munh par daagh denay se mana farmaya hai. (Muslim: 6/163)"
"1393","[AI-translation] Naim bin Abu Abdullah maula Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se suna, wo kehtay thay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik gadha dekha jis ke munh par daagh tha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ko napasand kiya aur Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam main daagh nahi deta magar us jagah par jo munh se bohat door hai, yani patha waghera, aur apne gadhay ko daagh denay ka hukm kiya to pathon par daagh diya gaya aur sab se pehle Aap, Ibn Abbas, ne hi pathon par daagha. (Muslim: 6/163-164). Baab: Bakriyon ke kaan mein daaghna. (Qaail Ibn Abbas hain; jaairatain koolhay ki haddiyan hain.)"
"1394","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas baaray mein gaye, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bakriyon ko kaanon par daagh de rahay thay. (Muslim: 6/164). Baab: Peeth par daaghna."
"1395","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Umm Sulaim ne bacha jana, to mujh se kaha ke Ae Anas! Dekh ye bacha kuch na khanay peenay paye jab tak tu us ko subah ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas na le jaye aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kuch chaba kar us ke munh mein na daalein. Anas ne kaha ke phir main subah ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baagh mein thay aur, qabeela ya maqam, Jaun ki aik kamli orhay hue apne un oonton par daagh de rahay thay, jo fatah mein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye thay. (Muslim: 6/164). (Khamisa Jaun ki nisbat se hai.)"
